 A single key (or array of keys) that should be parsed as `Boolean`s.
 
+#### options.count
+Type: `Array|String`<br>
+Default: `[]`
+
+A single key (or array of keys) whose value is the number of times it was given, e.g. `-vvv` or `--verbose --verbose`. Aliases share the same count.
+
+```js
+mri(["-vvv"], { count: "v" });
+//=> { _:[], v:3 }
+```
+
 #### options.default
 Type: `Object`<br>
 Default: `{}`
